OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 13 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including Brahms and
OL,8,     GMayer live from the BBC
OL,9,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra's studio
OL,10,     Gin Salford Quays.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from Bristol Cathedral on
OL,13,     Gthe Eve of the Ascension, with
OL,14,     Gmusic by Stanford, Jonathan Dove,
OL,15,     GFinzi and Laurin.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Florence
OL,17,     FPrice
OL,18,     GFlorence Price takes the Windy
OL,19,     GCity by storm, as Kate Molleson
OL,20,     Gand Samantha Ege explore her
OL,21,     Grise, resilience and success in
OL,22,     GChicago.
