OL,13,     Gis joined by American star opera
OL,14,     Gsinger Joyce DiDonato in songs by
OL,15,     GAlma and Gustav Mahler, and it
OL,16,     Gperforms Richard Strauss's
OL,17,     GTransfiguration.
