OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 13 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: David Munrow - The
OL,5,     FPied Piper
OL,6,     GTo many, the recorder is a modest
OL,7,     Gschool instrument. Not for David
OL,8,     GMunrow, a musical maverick of the
OL,9,     G1960s, who transformed it into a
OL,10,     Gworld of colour, curiosity and
OL,11,     Gadventure.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
